左手拿着利乐包饮品用吸管饮用，她略低头，但眼珠看向镜头，微微害羞，露齿歪头微笑，生活抓拍。低照度电影布光，远处是暗调隐隐约约看到的日式现代公寓厨房，强烈的明暗对比。日系复古胶片摄影风格，黑暗的环境，闪光灯效果，柯达Portra 400胶片颗粒感，高噪点，低饱和度色调，暗角效果。浅景深，焦点集中在人物侧脸，背景模糊。氛围慵懒、松弛、私密、略带疏离感，褪色胶片质感，8K，写实摄影，不要有肢体错误。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [400, 200], "pos": [1575.52978515625, 0], "id": 207, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 2765, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "color_on": "#FF6E6E", "localized_name": "anything"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "anything2", "link": 2782, "label": "anything2", "type": "*", "color_on": "#B39DDB", "localized_name": "anything2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "anything3", "link": 2895, "label": "anything3", "type": "*", "color_on": "#FFA931", "localized_name": "anything3"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "Anything Everywhere3", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [179.97518920898438, 66], "pos": [827.8428955078125, 1002.1182861328125], "id": 195, "properties": {"color_restricted": 0, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Anything Everywhere3", "group_restricted": 0}, "order": 34}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [4244.16357421875, 188.47705078125], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [-825.8787841796875, -532.1699829101562], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true, "allow_interaction": true}, "id": 213, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#1B4669", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "center", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 111, "backgroundAlpha": 0.25, "lineHeight": 3, "text": "粉丝福利：点击\"右上角自己的头像\">邀请码>填写邀请码：【wefjn44t】送1000RH币", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#ff2929"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [3066.3